    "BrochureContent": [
      {
        "ContentType": "Description",
        "SortOrder": 0,
        "Content": "\nWonderful opportunity to acquire this attractive three-bedroom townhouse in one of Kilkenny City's most established and highly sought-after residential locations.\n\nAccommodation briefly comprises Living Room, Kitchen, 3 Bedrooms and Bathroom. Front and rear gardens with block shed in rear garden which accommodates washing machine/dryer. All contents are included in the sale.\n\nThis spacious and well-maintained home offers generous accommodation throughout and is ideally suited to first-time buyers, families and investors alike. A particular feature of the property is the large, south-facing rear garden, providing an excellent outdoor space with the added benefit of gated access from the communal rear access car road.\n\nSituated just off Dominic Street, the property enjoys an unbeatable location within a mature residential area, only a five-minute walk from Kilkenny City Centre. A wide range of amenities are on the doorstep, including shops, cafs, restaurants, schools, hospitals and excellent public transport links. The property also offers superb connectivity, with Kilkenny Ring Road just one minute away and the M9 Motorway approximately five minutes' drive, providing easy access to Dublin, Carlow and Waterford.\n\nAdditional features include oil-fired central heating, bright and spacious living accommodation, and an enviable city location that combines convenience with a peaceful residential setting.\n\nProperties in this location rarely remain on the market for long. Early viewing is highly recommended and is strictly by appointment.\n\n"
      },
